{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_008_03_j",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:8d16fd07c45f3250a779fa1c07845eb79a27c06491e4fb222e41e1312c0fcfb5",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_j:cmd-000027:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e",
      "text": "几天后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_j:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e6cc554b7d94202f7989b8594cc8ced98fbd884e66417134ac01850f0f54cb8d",
      "text": "太强啦——！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_j:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:226bb10654fa9c1007eea0e888596d84bcafbea9a9132376e3272e1c38de8a72",
      "text": "隼人亲，这首歌超级无敌特无敌帅气啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_j:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4cbf48aa8cf61fa99f598e89a7b8c6d7dde940e69a722407089ec9f4364fafd3",
      "text": "啊，超级赞不是吗！\n能写出这种曲子，真是太厉害了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_j:cmd-000088:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:056855aa4f47bd562865c23068a3ec8a3cd12b5bad9ac044c1dff215daf8234a",
      "text": "嗯……非常，好听的曲子……\n隼人，辛苦了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_j:cmd-000096:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f524257eae10d2469aa5455eb02e6d90c00fd1435ee727e465a9c2586c06f010",
      "text": "嘿嘿，虽然非常不容易，\n但因为有旬帮我，所以才能完成的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_j:cmd-000107:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1b91f22e8f0876f3ff5f3d5e3cfd6a1d324449d8333fc16d509d6bca6f706a6e",
      "text": "太夸张了。只是因为隼人卡壳了，\n我稍微提了点建议而已。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_j:cmd-000113:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:39de12d1aa73ca52c47aa845dce0cc6ec51cf939d25bf7d8e031a6d3025c6d3a",
      "text": "真不愧是，旬……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_j:cmd-000132:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e2dcd3d13b03aa828ee21a6cfc4be26b68d9f551ecac7c76a8051c34e41208ae",
      "text": "好嘞！既然他们两个都这么拼了，\n我们也不能落后啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_j:cmd-000139:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7b0b0400faf7a8f77d97143d701c5ceaf1c8f80d86ff9b8a87d44e5ae02bab5d",
      "text": "为了不和社团活动撞上，\n我去商量一下能不能调整打工的排班。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_j:cmd-000145:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a6c88b21cb3a4d9f9c4147cac78e8a92e5001fa46a99a67c58f8911e2377cdea",
      "text": "好——！我也已经考完补考了！\n从今天开始要超级拿出干劲唱歌了哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_j:cmd-000180:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6676de8e2c686e3f7d7d902564a7b9f27463994d9db6d7e743431448510b3771",
      "text": "好——嘞！\n为了大赛，大家一起努力练习吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_j:cmd-000198:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0522f5feb089c6d0ce8700a3a14d006211d88ef37bf2eed6509b13d9b6b2b377",
      "text": "噢——！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
